+# --- Smoke-test overrides (pass on CLI, don't edit here) ---
+# NOTE: do NOT lower max_seq_len — precomputed packs are token_budget=32768 and
+# BucketedPackDataset asserts materialized T==32768 (RoPE also asserts at 32k).
